From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kierandrewett <kieran@drewett.dev>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 16:33:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] test: cover Lua trackball and pointing-stick preferences

---
